1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
'이 나이에'라고 말하고 있나요?
Aren't you saying "at my age" to yourself?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,682
베케트는 말했어요.
Samuel Beckett wrote,

3
00:00:05,782 --> 00:00:12,913
시도했고, 실패했다. 상관없다. 더 잘 실패하라고.
"Ever tried. Ever failed. No matter. Try again. Fail again. Fail better."

4
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:17,044
이직 공고를 열었다 닫은 밤.
A night of opening a job posting, then closing it.

5
00:00:17,144 --> 00:00:23,500
늦어서가 아니라, 또 실패할까 겁나서일지도요.
Maybe you're not sure you can bear failing once more.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
그건 이미 해 본 사람의 마음이에요.
That's the heart of someone who has already tried once.
